OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks return after wildfire
OL,4,Acancellations
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirework displays are set to return
OL,7,Fafter being cancelled due to wildfire
OL,8,Fconcerns.
OL,10,FThe regular summer shows in Bournemouth
OL,11,Fand Poole were called off following a
OL,12,Fgovernment emergency alert on 14
OL,13,FAugust, which warned about the
OL,14,Fheightened risk of fires.
OL,16,FBCP Council said the displays would now
OL,17,Fresume at Poole Quay on Thursday 27
OL,18,FAugust, and at Bournemouth beach on
OL,19,FFriday 28 August, both starting at
OL,20,F22:00 BST, following discussions with
OL,21,Femergency services and a reduction in
OL,22,Fwildfire risk across the area.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
